Journey: demoqa alerts, frames and windows
Tags: @demoqa
Base URL: https://demoqa.com

Open /alerts
Accept the next dialog
Click the "Click me" button right of "Click Button to see alert"
  Expect an alert saying "You clicked a button"
Accept the next alert
Click the "Click me" button right of "On button click, alert will appear after 5 seconds"
  Expect an alert saying "This alert appeared after 5 seconds"
Accept the next confirm dialog
Click the "Click me" button right of "On button click, confirm box will appear"
  Expect the page contains "You selected Ok"
Answer the next prompt with "Ada Lovelace"
Click the "Click me" button right of "On button click, prompt box will appear"
  Expect the page contains "You entered Ada Lovelace"

Open /frames
In frame "frame1"
  Expect the "This is a sample page" heading is visible
End
In frame "frame2": expect the page contains "This is a sample page"

Open /nestedframes
In frame "frame1"
  Expect the page contains "Parent frame"
End
In frame "frame1" > iframe
  Expect the page contains "Child Iframe"
End

Open /browser-windows
Click the "New Tab" button and switch to the new tab
  Expect the URL contains "/sample"
  Expect the page contains "This is a sample page"
Switch back to the main tab
Click the "New Window" button and switch to the new window
  Expect the "This is a sample page" heading is visible
Close the window
Expect the page contains "Browser Windows"
